{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19642","headline":"送皇甫湜赴举 · 马异","name":"送皇甫湜赴举","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"马蹄声特特，去入天子国。\n借问去是谁，秀才皇甫湜。\n吞吐一腹文，八音兼五色。\n主文有崔李，郁郁爲朝德。\n青铜镜必明，朱丝绳必直。\n称意太平年，愿子长相忆。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"马异","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19642.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19642","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}